      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HTTP 403 with a machine reason code and a human sentence:\n  reason: data_class_blocked · policy: DATA-004 · class: customer_pii\n  destination: anthropic/eu-central-1 · alternative alias: aap-internal-secure\nThe same text appears in the console, the audit row and the client error.\nA developer who is blocked must know what to do next without filing a ticket.",
      "originalText": "HTTP 403 with a machine reason code and a human sentence:\n  reason: data_class_blocked · policy: DATA-004 · class: customer_pii\n  destination: anthropic/eu-central-1 · alternative alias: aap-internal-secure\nThe same text appears in the console, the audit row and the client error.\nA developer who is blocked must know what to do next without filing a ticket.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
